        "Small business",
        "Connectors",
        "Models",
        "Engineers"
      ],
      "text": "Private AI chat from Germany One private chat. Many worlds. Founders, small businesses, developers, students. They use the same app for very different work. Scroll down. Each world is a real use case. Download for Mac / Windows / Linux Web App → 100% open source · monthly subscription · no token stress Fast Private Founders Small business Connectors Models Engineers Prototypers Research On the go Scroll to begin",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
