    {
      "selector": "#private",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2700,
      "heading": "The questions you would not ask anyone else.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "01 of 09 The private questions The questions you would not ask anyone else. Health, money, a hard talk with your boss. People ask Chuk Chat the things they would never type into a data-hungry AI. Your chats are encrypted on your device before we store them. We keep only ciphertext. End-to-end encrypted storage Never used for training No tracking +c0 0U W 3WwK ja Ib2t a163 2 fj NOoifi Eyxz Thought for 4s 3C==g KAIk MuBbRb O=u cJBE 3ilzuF L4W kj9 1i 6U1aE4x 02 H fUR6 fEJ14LK VAU V/h1 VetSX5Da KvMS+C FMTxqo ZWd2 zZqrh fVxoL 9v8 TqqBn Pp0jecnV OGqI dPlC0 EfYwS9Do Cgw 5 r6sqHh Ask me anything ! Fas",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#founders",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 3780,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2916,
      "heading": "From idea to launch page in one chat.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [
        "https://artifacts.chuk.chat/k7f2-spoke"
      ],
      "text": "02 of 09 Building a product to sell From idea to launch page in one chat. Founders research the market, write the pitch, draft the code and publish a landing page with a public link. Connect GitHub, Stripe or Vercel and work with your real project. Your idea stays your idea. We do not train on it. Web research Artifacts with public links GitHub · Stripe · Vercel Build a landing page for my bike repair service and publish it. Worked for 12s Ran artifact manager Ran create artifact Spoke landing page HTML · v1 Download Open Done. Your page is live, and anyone with the link can open it: https://a",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#business",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 6696,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2916,
      "heading": "The office work, done between two jobs.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "03 of 09 Running a small business The office work, done between two jobs. A carpenter writes the invoice as a clean PDF on the way to the next customer. A café owner answers emails and plans the shifts. Appointments go straight into the calendar. No IT department needed. PDF documents Email drafts Calendar and reminders Write the invoice for Mrs Weber: kitchen shelf, 6 hours at €58, material €140. As PDF. Worked for 6s Ran typst compile Invoice Mrs Weber Typst · PDF · v1 Download Open Now write Mrs Weber a short email about it. Your invoice 2026-031 To weber@example.de Dear Mrs Weber, thank yo",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#connectors",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 9612,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2700,
      "heading": "All your tools. One chat to drive them.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "04 of 09 Connecting every tool All your tools. One chat to drive them. Knowledge workers connect Notion, Linear, Todoist, Dropbox and 50 more services. You sign in once in the browser. Then you ask in plain words, and Chuk Chat does the clicking across all of them. 50+ connectors (MCP) Sign in with OAuth Desktop and Android What is due this week? Check Linear, Todoist and Notion, then make me a plan. Worked for 9s Ran linear list issues Ran todoist find-tasks Searchedlaunch plan Your week, in order: Mon: fix the login bug (Linear, high priority) Tue: send the Q3 report (Todoist) Thu: review th",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#models",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 12312,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 3132,
      "heading": "Stop paying for five AI subscriptions.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "05 of 09 Every model, one budget Stop paying for five AI subscriptions. Some models write better. Some think deeper. Some are fast and cheap. Power users pick a different model for each message and pay from one budget: €20 per month, with €16 in AI credits included. No second account, no second invoice. Frontier open-weight models Switch for each message €16 AI credits included Write my cover letter for the office manager job. Thought for 3s Dear Ms Berger, I am applying for the office manager position… Check the salary maths: €4,250 per month, 13 salaries. Thought for 6s Correct: €4,250 × 13 ",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#engineers",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 15444,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2916,
      "heading": "Five chats running. None of them waits for you.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "06 of 09 Many tasks at once Five chats running. None of them waits for you. Engineers start a refactor in one chat, a research question in the next and a bug hunt in a third. Answers keep streaming when you switch chats. Code lands in editable panels, and on desktop a sandboxed shell runs commands for you. Parallel streaming Code artifacts Sandboxed shell (desktop) Pinned 2 Load test the new sync API Mon, Sep 21 Team code style guide Wed, Aug 12 Today 5 Refactor the auth service 14:32 Why is the CI build slow? 14:28 Migrate to Dart 3.13 14:21 Explain this stack trace 14:09 Regex for German IBA",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#prototypers",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 18360,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2916,
      "heading": "From a sketch to a clickable prototype.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "07 of 09 The prototyper From a sketch to a clickable prototype. Prototypers sketch a flow, turn it into a clickable HTML page and generate the images for it. Each idea takes minutes, not days. Keep the good ones. Delete the rest. Excalidraw sketches HTML previews Image generation Sketch a signup flow with an email code. Worked for 8s Ran artifact manager Signup flow Excalidraw sketch · v1 Download Open Make it a clickable page. Worked for 11s Signup page HTML · v1 Download Open Add a hero image. Worked for 5s Z-Image Turbo Ask me anything ! Fast You're chatting with an AI/LLM — it can be wrong",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#research",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 21276,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2700,
      "heading": "Talk to your documents. Get answers with sources.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "08 of 09 Research and documents Talk to your documents. Get answers with sources. Students and researchers attach PDFs, notes and papers and ask questions about them. Chuk Chat searches the web, names its sources, draws charts and writes the result as a typeset PDF. Old chats stay searchable. PDF and file attachments Web search with sources Charts and PDF export thesis_draft.pdf miller_2024.pdf Compare the methods in both papers. Show the response rates as a chart. Worked for 14s Searchedsurvey response rates by method n nature.com a arxiv.org D destatis.de P pewresearch.org Both papers measur",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
    {
      "selector": "#onthego",
      "type": "content",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 23976,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 2700,
      "heading": "Hold the home button. Ask. Done.",
      "backgroundColor": "#FDFBF7",
      "callsToAction": [],
      "text": "09 of 09 On the go Hold the home button. Ask. Done. On Android, Chuk Chat can be your assistant. Hold the home gesture, and it listens, reads what is on the screen, answers out loud and acts. It sets alarms, finds places and starts the navigation. Android assistant Voice in, voice out Places, routes, alarms 18:42 Fri, Sep 25 14°C Calendar Clock Photos Weather Notes Files Settings Chuk Chat Pharmacy Pharmacy at the market Marktplatz 4 Pharmacy · open until 20:00 4.7 (128) Linden Pharmacy Lindenstraße 21 Pharmacy · open until 19:00 4.5 (86) Harbour Pharmacy Kaistraße 8 Pharmacy · open until 18:3",
      "layout": "centered",
      "assetUrls": []
    },
